        "curated_prompt": "MySQLQueryBuilder.__copy__ returns None\n\nCopying a MySQL query builder should return a distinct MySQLQueryBuilder with the same query state. It currently returns None. This also breaks query-building operations that copy a builder internally, sometimes before a chained query has finished being constructed.\n\nA direct, bounded reproduction avoids requiring a working query chain first:\n\n```python\nfrom copy import copy\nfrom pypika.dialects import MySQLQueryBuilder\n\nquery = MySQLQueryBuilder()\ncopied_query = copy(query)\nprint(copied_query is None)\nprint(type(copied_query).__name__)\n```\n\nExpected output:\n\n```text\nFalse\nMySQLQueryBuilder\n```\n\nCurrent output:\n\n```text\nTrue\nNoneType\n```\n\nNormal MySQL query construction and copying should remain usable.\n",
